{"title":"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of the 5 answers shown, what is the largest amount of postage you cannot make using only 5¢ and 8¢ stamps?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/d/33dc5884d6283c18b65dd39dc162076e8ed2edde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\$19.00 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$22.00 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$27.00 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$39.00 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\$41.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"558\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Remark: It's not dollars. It's cents\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We go from the E to A, since we are looking for the largest amount of postage. We immediately look to the Frobenius number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, since they are relatively prime. Using the formula, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/b/14b320f85606b1e9c157b554a394aa29c4d284ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 \\cdot 8)-5-8=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"129\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aae61f07710db0b32eae2a2ec3ac0a4d50cd23df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}~\\frac{27}{1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"69\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (G